r":37,"content":"- 2026-10-17 · gotcha · [0.5] · `h-mad,phase7,regression-guards,handoff:2026-10-17-agy-coder-fallback-merged` — Adding a warning/verdict code breaks guards that assert 'no warnings' or an exact set; grep tests for not result['warnings'] and exact-set equality before adding one"},{"line_number":38,"content":"- 2026-10-17 · gotcha · [0.7] · `testing,hostile-fixtures,path,handoff:2026-10-17-agy-coder-fallback-merged` — A PATH entry cannot contain ':' — a hostile-payload root with ':' blinds shutil.which to its stub bin; put hostile bytes in args/file contents, never in a dir placed on PATH"},{"line_number":39,"content":"- 2026-10-17 · gotcha · [0.7] · `h-mad,codex,suite,handoff:2026-10-17-agy-coder-fallback-merged` — Never let Codex run the full h-mad suite in its sandbox: ~20 min eats the exec watchdog and no report returns; orchestrator runs the full suite outside"},{"line_number":40,"content":"- 2026-10-17 · gotcha · [0.7] · `h-mad,codex,sandbox,handoff:2026-10-17-agy-coder-fallback-merged` — Codex workspace-write sandbox: leak-reaper teardown ps → PermissionError makes every scoped pytest exit 1 and the mutation harness refuse its baseline; declare it in the prompt as non-STATUS and score sweeps/suites outside the sandbox"}]}]},"locations":[]}
