{"type":"thought","data":"The feature is already"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implemented in the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"tree."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit targets "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the PLAN document, not"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the implementation."}
{"type":"thought","data":" I will look for real"}
{"type":"thought","data":" defects in the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that could mislead "}
{"type":"thought","data":"implementers, such as"}
{"type":"thought","data":" TBD placeholders, vague"}
{"type":"thought","data":" requirements, incorrect"}
{"type":"thought","data":" file paths, or type"}
{"type":"thought","data":" mismatches."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" cannot serve as the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" specification. I will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" check for internal "}
{"type":"thought","data":"contradictions in the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan, such as Task "}
{"type":"thought","data":"20 claiming six versus"}
{"type":"thought","data":" three items, and Task"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 9 claiming eight versus"}
{"type":"thought","data":" nine rows. I will also"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verify that code blocks"}
{"type":"thought","data":" match functions the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan claims exist today."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nCross-document consistency"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with the design file"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on disk is another "}
{"type":"thought","data":"audit target. I will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" verify claims about"}
{"type":"thought","data":" artifacts that did "}
{"type":"thought","data":"not change, or read "}
{"type":"thought","data":"unchanged code to confirm"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan's signatures."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nChecking the current"}
{"type":"thought","data":" tree against the plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" pre-change row counts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" would be invalid, since"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan itself adds"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rows. The audit will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" focus on contradictions"}
{"type":"thought","data":" between the design "}
{"type":"thought","data":"file and the plan, and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on internal bugs within"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan itself."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nI will check the target"}
{"type":"thought","data":" interface code blocks"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the plan for internal"}
{"type":"thought","data":" inconsistencies. I "}
{"type":"thought","data":"will also look at prior"}
{"type":"thought","data":" audit reports in .hmad-report"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to avoid repeating "}
{"type":"thought","data":"fixed issues. The plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" version history shows"}
{"type":"thought","data":" v1.2 was the final "}
{"type":"thought","data":"corrective not re-audited,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and Task 20 contains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a v1.3 amendment."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan header and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" version history both"}
{"type":"thought","data":" omit the v1.3 amendment"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in Task 20. The document"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is still labeled plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" v1.6, so this is a "}
{"type":"thought","data":"measurement nit."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nTask 20's six-versus-three"}
{"type":"thought","data":" contradiction is confirmed"}
{"type":"thought","data":" in the file. I will"}
{"type":"thought","data":" read Task 9 and count"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the actual hook_wiring_agy.json"}
{"type":"thought","data":" rows to resolve its"}
{"type":"thought","data":" eight-versus-nine discrepancy."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The design document's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" FR-4 mutation killer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for empty strings conflicts"}
{"type":"thought","data":" with plan I1; the plan"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is the correction."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nTask 12 item 3 is "}
{"type":"thought","data":"not a plan bug. The "}
{"type":"thought","data":"agy fixture test still"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fails the parametrized"}
{"type":"thought","data":" suite, so it correctly"}
{"type":"thought","data":" kills the targeted "}
{"type":"thought","data":"mutant.\n\nTask 7 item"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 11 is internally consistent."}
{"type":"thought","data":" Six ids from Task 5"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plus seven from Task"}
