{"type":"thought","data":"A significant gap exists"}
{"type":"thought","data":" between the plan and"}
{"type":"thought","data":" implementation. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plan itself may be "}
{"type":"thought","data":"wrong."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan specifies"}
{"type":"thought","data":" patching `_safe_shell_command`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to return True for "}
{"type":"thought","data":"the self-check policy"}
{"type":"thought","data":" failure test."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe plan omits whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to patch the gate or"}
{"type":"thought","data":" identity module. Codex"}
{"type":"thought","data":" Task 4 explicitly targets"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the gate module. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" design places `_safe_shell_command`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" inside main's try as"}
{"type":"thought","data":" a local name, so monkeypatching"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the gate module may"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not reach it."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nPatching the gate "}
{"type":"thought","data":"module would not reach"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the local import inside"}
{"type":"thought","data":" main. The implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" patches both the policy"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and gate modules, but"}
{"type":"thought","data":" only the policy patch"}
{"type":"thought","data":" actually works because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" main imports from the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" identity module."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe gate patch uses"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `raising=False` because"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the name may not exist"}
{"type":"thought","data":" on that module. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" mutation row changes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the shell-policy branch"}
{"type":"thought","data":" from returning 0 to"}
{"type":"thought","data":" returning 2, but the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test still passes if"}
{"type":"thought","data":" it forces that branch."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan's instruction"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to patch `_safe_shell_command`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to return True omits"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which object receives"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the patch."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nAn implementer who"}
{"type":"thought","data":" patches only the gate"}
{"type":"thought","data":" module would write "}
{"type":"thought","data":"a broken test. The local"}
{"type":"thought","data":" import inside main "}
{"type":"thought","data":"would still call the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" real function, so self-check"}
{"type":"thought","data":" prints PASS and returns"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 0. The assertion expecting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" FAIL shell-policy would"}
{"type":"thought","data":" fail even when the "}
{"type":"thought","data":"mutation is green. This"}
{"type":"thought","data":" confirms the plan omits"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the identity module"}
{"type":"thought","data":" patch."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe correct patch "}
{"type":"thought","data":"target is `h_mad_target_identity._safe_shell_command`,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" applied before `main()`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" so the local import"}
{"type":"thought","data":" inside `main` binds"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the patched function."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan's omission"}
{"type":"thought","data":" of this module-level"}
{"type":"thought","data":" target is a writing-plans"}
{"type":"thought","data":" quality issue, though"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the mutation and assertions"}
{"type":"thought","data":" themselves are clear."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe ambiguity is a"}
{"type":"thought","data":" should-fix, not a hard"}
{"type":"thought","data":" gap. An implementer"}
{"type":"thought","data":" can still write a passing"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test."}
