{"type":"thought","data":"A serious implementation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" bug has been spotted."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The question is whether"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the plan itself contains"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the error."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe `main()` function"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is being examined. "}
{"type":"thought","data":"It contains a self-check"}
{"type":"thought","data":" block with early returns"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for classification "}
{"type":"thought","data":"and shell-policy failures,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" plus exception handling"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and a finally clause."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe `main()` logic"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is correct. Both the"}
{"type":"thought","data":" FAIL and exception "}
{"type":"thought","data":"paths preserve their"}
{"type":"thought","data":" intended exit codes."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The plan's mutation"}
{"type":"thought","data":" `selfcheck-verdict-fail-exits-2`"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is therefore invalid."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe audit is shifting"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to the plan itself."}
{"type":"thought","data":" A potential conflict"}
{"type":"thought","data":" between Task 5's \"exit"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 0 always\" requirement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and the self-check "}
{"type":"thought","data":"exit code of 2 is being"}
{"type":"thought","data":" examined."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe trailing `return"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 0` is unreachable when"}
{"type":"thought","data":" the exception handler"}
{"type":"thought","data":" returns 2. The plan's"}
{"type":"thought","data":" \"exit 0 always\" requirement"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is therefore impossible"}
{"type":"thought","data":" to satisfy."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe main must-fix "}
{"type":"thought","data":"is Task 20.\n\nA new issue"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is emerging around "}
{"type":"thought","data":"Task 3. The hook at "}
{"type":"thought","data":"RED uses the old grammar"}
{"type":"thought","data":" and authorship logic,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" not the author field"}
{"type":"thought","data":" that format_state_line"}
{"type":"thought","data":" will emit later."}
{"type":"thought","data":"\n\nThe old codex-authorship"}
{"type":"thought","data":" block still triggers"}
{"type":"thought","data":" at RED when a codex"}
{"type":"thought","data":" stub is on PATH. The"}
{"type":"thought","data":" test therefore passes"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for the old reason,"}
{"type":"thought","data":" which is acceptable"}
{"type":"thought","data":" for a P regression "}
{"type":"thought","data":"guard. The new behavior"}
{"type":"thought","data":" is already pinned by"}
{"type":"thought","data":" other F tests.\n\nItem"}
{"type":"thought","data":" 12 P is now under scrutiny."}
{"type":"thought","data":" The unknown author "}
{"type":"thought","data":"grok case may fail at"}
{"type":"thought","data":" RED because the old"}
{"type":"thought","data":" grammar rejects extra fields."}
